al as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s & ={∮}_{C}P\\,\\text{d}y-Q\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }(P\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}-Q\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }(12\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\cdot (2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)-(6\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\cdot (-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }24{cos}^{2}⁡t+24{sin}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }24\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =24t\\,{|}_{0}^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =24(2\\pi -0) \\\\  & =48\\pi \\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342803 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342804 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342805 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342806 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342807 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1041 "selection" 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342806 13194139535303 true] [17592186342802 1110 #uuid "34b8990b-4e8b-5e7a-b0d1-a90b0d9e60c6" 13194139535303 true] [17592186342803 1034 "24\\pi " 13194139535303 true] [17592186342803 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535303 true] [17592186342803 1111 #uuid "81976287-3d1c-5ffa-8634-11221c093597" 13194139535303 true] [17592186342804 1034 "-24\\pi " 13194139535303 true] [17592186342804 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535303 true] [17592186342804 1111 #uuid "d0525412-a7e7-5d27-96f7-24b19bd93dc2" 13194139535303 true] [17592186342805 1034 "-48\\pi " 13194139535303 true] [17592186342805 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535303 true] [17592186342805 1111 #uuid "2e33fdcd-2744-56bb-b52b-9d74d824fba3" 13194139535303 true] [17592186342806 1034 "48\\pi " 13194139535303 true] [17592186342806 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535303 true] [17592186342806 1111 #uuid "7a71f602-30e0-527c-a5